@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam dpi 120
hide empty members
top to bottom direction
title SkyCrop - Drone Management - Diseño por capas
package "Interfaces / Presentation" {
class DroneController <<controller>> {
-service: IDroneApplicationService
+register(request: RegisterDroneRequest): DroneResource
+getById(id: Long): DroneResource
}
class RegisterDroneRequest <<request>> {
-ownerId: Long
-serialNumber: String
-model: String
}
class DroneResource <<resource>> {
-id: Long
}
class DroneResourceAssembler <<assembler>> {
+toResource(entity: Drone): DroneResource
}
}
package "Application" {
class RegisterDroneCommand <<command>> {
-ownerId: Long
-serialNumber: String
-model: String
}
interface IDroneApplicationService {
+register(command: RegisterDroneCommand): DroneResource
+getById(id: Long): DroneResource
}
class DroneApplicationService <<application service>> {
-repository: IDroneRepository
+register(command: RegisterDroneCommand): DroneResource
+getById(id: Long): DroneResource
}
}
package "Domain" {
class Drone <<aggregate root>> {
-id: Long
-serialNumber: String
-status: DroneStatus
+configure(): void
}
interface IDroneRepository <<repository contract>> {
+findById(id: Long): Drone [0..1]
+save(entity: Drone): void
}
}
package "Infrastructure" {
class DroneRepository <<repository>> {
-dbContext: SkyCropDbContext
+findById(id: Long): Drone [0..1]
+save(entity: Drone): void
}
class SkyCropDbContext <<EF Core>> {
+saveChanges(): int
}
}
DroneController --> IDroneApplicationService : delega
DroneController ..> RegisterDroneRequest : recibe
DroneController ..> RegisterDroneCommand : construye
DroneController ..> DroneResource : responde
DroneApplicationService ..|> IDroneApplicationService
IDroneApplicationService ..> RegisterDroneCommand : recibe
DroneApplicationService --> IDroneRepository : consulta y persiste
DroneApplicationService ..> Drone : ejecuta operaciones
DroneApplicationService ..> DroneResourceAssembler : transforma
DroneResourceAssembler ..> Drone : lee
DroneResourceAssembler ..> DroneResource : produce
DroneRepository ..|> IDroneRepository
IDroneRepository ..> Drone : contrato de persistencia
DroneRepository --> SkyCropDbContext : acceso a datos
package "Application" {
interface IDroneGateway <<integration contract>> {
+connect(droneId: Long): boolean
}
}
package "Infrastructure" {
class DroneGatewayAdapter <<adapter>> {
+connect(droneId: Long): boolean
}
}
DroneApplicationService --> IDroneGateway : solicita operación
DroneGatewayAdapter ..|> IDroneGateway
note bottom of DroneGatewayAdapter
Encapsula la comunicación con el dispositivo registrado.
end note
DroneController -[hidden]down-> DroneApplicationService
DroneApplicationService -[hidden]down-> Drone
Drone -[hidden]down-> DroneRepository
legend bottom
Arquitectura de clases propuesta para el backend RESTful API.
La vista muestra un caso de uso del contexto y su consulta por identidad.
Los atributos del agregado se detallan en las vistas del dominio.
Las dependencias de infraestructura implementan contratos internos.
endlegend
@enduml
